  "title": "Cream of Spinach Soup",
  "description": "Sauteed chopped spinach is added to a roux-thickened mixture of milk and chicken bouillon for a fast and easy-to-prepare soup. This technique works well with a variety of vegetables.",
  "authors": [
    "Joyce Marciszewski"
